ie Lee</strong><p>jamie@studio.design</p></div></div><div className="modal-note">24 components · 12 context rules · 48 design tokens</div></>:<><p>One component. A clear purpose. The right presentation, every time.</p><div className="guide-step"><span>01</span><div><strong>Build your component</strong><p>Define a reusable button, alert, input, or card.</p></div></div><div className="guide-step"><span>02</span><div><strong>Give it semantic context</strong><p>Choose default, success, warning, or danger to express intent.</p></div></div><div className="guide-step"><span>03</span><div><strong>Let the design adapt</strong><p>Color, content, icons, and behavior respond together.</p></div></div><button className="primary-button" onClick={()=>{setModal(null);setPage('Playground')}}>Try the playground<Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></button></>}</section></div>}
